documentation
testingAndTools

	^ 'Headless UI testing and tooling: BlDevScripter (Bloc-Scripter) drives a space step by step (click, type, wait, check children/classes) without opening a real window, ideal for exercising the HSK app and later the game. BlocHost-Mock offers a headless host; elements also know exportAsPNG/exportAsForm for visual snapshots and inspectionPreview: for debugging. Keep widgets/elements detached from any space in unit tests: geometry, composition and text styling work without a space.'